summary":"This is a simple market-analysis service description with pricing, and I found no hidden execution, credential access, persistence, or destructive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"No local file access, credential use, account mutation, network execution code, or broad indexing is requested; the visible API snippet is illustrative and scoped to market analysis.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains only SKILL.md and package.json with no install scripts, executable files, dependencies, or remote payload retrieval instructions.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger list includes broad terms such as '趋势' and 'market analysis', which could cause over-activation, but it does not instruct the agent to take sensitive or high-impact actions automatically.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence mechanisms, background workers, scheduled tasks, memory writes, privilege escalation, or tool-hijacking instructions were present.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is market trend, competitor, user behavior, and report analysis; the artifact contains only descriptive service content, pricing, and an example API request.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, users should understand this appears to be a paid, China-oriented market-analysis skill. Its broad triggers may activate in general trend or market-analysis conversations, so confirm scope and cost before requesting specialized reports.","findings":"[SQP-1] unexpected: The broad trigger terms are a real quality and routing concern, especially for a paid analysis service, but artifact evidence does not show hidden behavior, high-impact authority, or unsafe automatic execution.\n[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese/CN language framing matches the package name and service presentation; clearer language-scope documentation would help users, but it is not a security concern.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The static scan reported no T01-T09 security results, which is consistent with the inspected artifact containing only markdown instructions and minimal package metadata.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789071110870}}}}}